{"id":"lavage","lemma":"lavage","pos":"noun","rank":4401,"glosses":["washing (act of washing)"],"ipa":"/la.vaʒ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lavages"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-lavage.wav","formAudio":{"lavages":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-lavages.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon jeans a rétréci au lavage.","en":"My jeans shrank in the wash.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"a pair of jeans","l":"jean"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to shrink","l":"rétrécir"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Je pense que tu as subi un lavage de cerveau.","en":"I think you've been brainwashed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to suffer","l":"subir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"brain"}]},{"text":"Certains pensent que la pub est une forme de lavage de cerveaux.","en":"Some people think that advertising is a form of brainwashing.","words":[{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Television ad or advert"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"brain","l":"cerveau"}]},{"text":"Le lavage des mains est recommandé pour prévenir la propagation de maladies contagieuses comme un coronavirus.","en":"Hand washing is recommended to prevent the spread of contagious diseases like a coronavirus.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"hand","l":"main"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"recommended"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to prevent"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"propagation"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"illness, disease","l":"maladie"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}